  storyText: 'Just Another Night


    (Game controls - numbers to choose the answer,
    Q to exit!)


    You are in a bar in Kabuki, Watson. Nothing special, just a
    popular place on the streets of Night City, 2077. Neon buzzes, a jukebox plays
    samurai-era rock, two guys argue about a braindance.


    You feel bored. Do
    you want to buy a drink?


    You have 20 eb.


    1. Buy a drink (-5 eb)

    2.
    Nah'
